    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acdbd57dcf21dfc0ee31b4ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──我从她轻声说出的短短几个字里，\n感受到前所未有的强烈决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f87ec8f18546dccc48c432241f0399edef28c8a19371d029e9ee08a588afb1ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fa6d731af740c299f8a252a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我回想起这一年的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dc044faff6997ef12f92587b4b07de96da519827a7e6707e4d1f6cf561ea895",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:977ddba06b56a1813a0bcfa1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在她跑步的样子上看到梦想后，\n开始与她一起挑战闪耀系列赛的日子。\n我一开始经常对她自由奔放的个性感到困惑──",
      "source_fingerprint": "85476c8e43d30d1497c1e96a6113cda14684742f946a3a246ce50ac055e484ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
