    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adea6da0ce4b1b74ac0b263c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“鲁道夫的实力比较强吧。”“千明太爱跟人\n对决。”“但千明的比赛看起来比较开心。”\n“鲁道夫一定能拿下三冠。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "d499b68bde067263bfcf1d63a4943c579a0161c08ecbba03409f5fb255c4614c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
